      "text": "I told Congressman Cory Mills of Florida, a friend of mine, to get out of the Race, but he wouldn\u2019t listen. He thought he could win, so who can blame him? We now have a great candidate, Ryan Elijah, running in his place! Ryan stands for EVERYTHING MAGA, and is respected by ALL. He has my Complete and Total Endorsement! President DONALD J. TRUMP",
